      "initialText": "FIELD KILN\nObjects for everyday rituals\nAn illustrative pottery shop\nCART / 0\nTHE COLLECTION   /   EVERYDAY TEAPOT\n01 / EVERYDAY FORM\n650 ml\nGLAZED STONEWARE\n\nOriginal vector illustration of a fictional sample product; not a photograph. Iron glaze shown.\n\nA PLACE AT YOUR TABLE\n\nA simple vessel.\nA little time for tea.\n\nHandmade ceramic teapot · Everyday collection\n\nFIELD KILN / TABLEWARE\n\nEveryday\nTeapot\n$68.00 USD\n650 ml capacity\n\nA handmade stoneware teapot for the familiar ritual of making tea. A rounded body, a generous handle, and a quiet presence on the table.\n\n01   Choose a glaze\nIron\n4 in stock\nAsh\nUnavailable\nSand\n7 in stock\n02   Quantity\n1\n2\n3\n4\nAvailable to order\nPieces (1)\n$68.00\nDomestic shipping\n$8.00\nOrder total USD\n$76.00\nAdd to simulated cart\n↗\n\nA practice purchase. No payment or real order.\n\nDelivery\n\nDispatch in 2 business days; illustrative domestic transit 3–5 business days.\n\nReturns\n\nUnused pieces accepted within 30 days. Customer pays return shipping; original shipping is nonrefundable.\n\nMADE FOR DAILY USE\nKnow your piece.\nMaterial & size\n\nGlazed stoneware\n\n16 cm wide × 12 cm high\n650 ml capacity\n\nCare for your teapot\n\nHand wash. Avoid sudden temperature changes. Not for stovetop use.\n\nFIELD KILN\n\nFictional shop and illustrative product, price, stock, delivery, and returns.\n\nMade for a slower moment.",
